Description: Abseil random_internal_sequence_urbg library
URL: https://abseil.io/
Version: 20260107
Requires: absl_config = 20260107
Libs: -L${libdir}  -Wl,--push-state,--as-needed -latomic -Wl,--pop-state
Cflags: -I${includedir} -DNOMINMAX
